        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDH35, 3-1/2 Inch Castle Style Decorative Baseboard Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-1/2\" Decorative Baseboard Door Stop is mounted to the baseboard or door bottom, to protect not just the door, but your wall and knob or door lever. It is made out of solid brass and is available in 9 beautiful finishes. This heavy duty decorative door holder has a concealed screw mounting for an elegant but sturdy installation. Come packages with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDH35-specifications.gif?v=1704354625\" width\"238\" height=\"212\" border=\"0\" atl=\"3-1/2 Inch Castle Style Decorative Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/replacement-domed-rubber-tip-for-baseboard-door-stop\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana BDH35 Decorative Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Tip Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base: 1-5/8\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Tips: White and Gray Tips included</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BDH35.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  BDH35 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose on the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
