                "description": "3-1/2 Inch Castle Style Decorative Baseboard Door Stop, Deltana BDH35 - The 3-1/2 Decorative Baseboard Door Stop is mounted to the baseboard or door bottom, to protect not just the door, but your wall and knob or door lever. It is made out of solid brass and is available in 9 beautiful finishes. This heavy duty decorative door holder has a concealed screw mounting for an elegant but sturdy installation. Come packages with the mounting hardware.",
